    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be a linear function and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"><mtr><mtd><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math> is</p>"
